Add a binding and driver for the STMicroelectronics FTS5CU56A touch
controller used on the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q, SM7125).

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

